    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111328" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλόμῡθ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fond of legends</i> or
				<i>fables,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ φ. φιλόσοφός πώς ἐστιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					982b18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Gal.</u>
				39b
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλομυθία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				1.2.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				9.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>talkative,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1117b34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				668
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			).</div>
